#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs
msgid "Web Remote"
msgstr "Webfjernbetjening"

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs
msgid ""
"Turn on to control this player from a phone or tablet on the same network. "
"HTTP is not encrypted: use only a trusted private network. Scan the QR code "
"with the phone's camera to open the remote."
msgstr ""
"Slå til for at styre denne afspiller fra en telefon eller tablet på samme "
"netværk. HTTP er ikke krypteret: brug kun et betroet privat netværk. Scan QR-"
"koden med telefonens kamera for at åbne fjernbetjeningen."

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs
msgid "Enable web remote"
msgstr "Aktivér webfjernbetjening"

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs
msgid "QR code"
msgstr "QR-kode"

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs
msgid "Web remote is off."
msgstr "Webfjernbetjeningen er slået fra."

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs
msgid "KDE Connect / GSConnect"
msgstr "KDE Connect / GSConnect"

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs
msgid ""
"If you have KDE Connect (Plasma, Android) or GSConnect (GNOME) installed, "
"your paired phone already shows media controls, track information and volume "
"for this player - no extra setup is required on our side."
msgstr ""
"Hvis du har KDE Connect (Plasma, Android) eller GSConnect (GNOME) "
"installeret, viser din parrede telefon allerede mediekontroller, "
"nummeroplysninger og lydstyrke for denne afspiller – ingen ekstra opsætning "
"er nødvendig fra vores side."

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs
msgid "Install KDE Connect on your phone"
msgstr "Installér KDE Connect på din telefon"

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs
msgid ""
"Open the link on the phone's app store. Pair once - then media keys, "
"notifications and file sharing work both ways."
msgstr ""
"Åbn linket i telefonens appbutik. Par én gang – derefter virker medietaster, "
"notifikationer og fildeling begge veje."

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs
msgid "Open KDE Connect download page"
msgstr "Åbn downloadsiden for KDE Connect"

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs
msgid "No local network found. Connect to a network and try again."
msgstr ""
"Der blev ikke fundet noget lokalt netværk. Opret forbindelse til et netværk, "
"og prøv igen."

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs
msgid "Scan the code with the phone's camera."
msgstr "Scan koden med telefonens kamera."

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs
#, rust-format
msgid "Web remote stopped: {error}"
msgstr "Webfjernbetjeningen stoppede: {error}"

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs
msgid "Could not start server"
msgstr "Kunne ikke starte serveren"

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs
msgctxt "BCP 47 language tag of this translation"
msgid "en"
msgstr "da"

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs
msgid "Remote control"
msgstr "Fjernbetjening"

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs
msgid "Media"
msgstr "Medier"

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs
msgid "Playback progress"
msgstr "Afspilningsforløb"

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs
msgid "Connecting…"
msgstr "Opretter forbindelse…"

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs
msgid "Connected to your computer"
msgstr "Forbundet til din computer"

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs
msgid "Disconnected. Check the network and keep the player open."
msgstr "Afbrudt. Kontrollér netværket, og hold afspilleren åben."

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs
msgid ""
"Use only on a trusted local network. This HTTP connection is not encrypted."
msgstr ""
"Brug kun på et lokalt netværk, du stoler på. Denne HTTP-forbindelse er ikke "
"krypteret."

